  "caption": "Quinn watched one ice bath video, bought eight bags of ice, and lasted four seconds.\n\nCold water immersion can modestly ease soreness and fatigue for a day or two after hard exercise, but the effect is smaller than the hype. Used straight after strength training, it may blunt gains over time.\n\nIdeas that can help: save it for quick turnarounds like back-to-back game days, skip the post-gym plunge in a muscle-building phase, keep sessions modest (around 10–15°C for 10–15 minutes), rewarm afterwards, and never plunge alone.\n\nIf you have a heart condition, blood pressure issues, Raynaud's or are pregnant, talk to your GP first. A fresh injury still needs assessment.\n\nOur Sydney CBD and Chatswood physios can help. Book via the link in bio.\n\nGeneral information only — not a substitute for an individual assessment.",
